  "description": "\"Wanna date for just six months?\" \n\nExhausted by her father's constant pressure to go on arranged dates, Chaeyun plans to study abroad in six months and proposes a contract relationship to her childhood friend, Taesan. Looking at Chaeyun's sparkling eyes, Taesan smiled meaningfully and said, \"Well, there are a lot of things I want to do with a lover... Can you handle it?\" \n\n\"Of course! Just name it.\" \n\n\"Alright. For six months, in exchange for being your boyfriend, I'm going to do everything a lover can do.\" \n\nAt that moment, Chaeyun became the temporary lover of Taesan, the male friend who used to feel like family.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70271246/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%84%EC%B0%94%ED%95%9C-%EB%82%A8%EC%82%AC%EC%B9%9C-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4964)   \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70270854/)",
